title: following, as built
pid: 9de8dfe7-44b0-4154-b24d-2152728373d9
body: |2-
  How one graph follows another today, as of 2026-11-14. The code is
  the authority; this says what it cannot say cheaply. The user's
  walkthroughs are 'docs/forks.org' and 'docs/sharing-model.org'.
  What is drawn where was read from 'server/refresh/'. Only the
  substitution under a foreign root, both ways of following, has been
  seen in a running view (2026-11-14, on the fixture of
  'tests/integration/overrides-followed'); the rest of this map has not.
